  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Saneamiento de los Distritos de Arraijan y La Chorrera - PSACH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sanitation Program for the Districts of Arraijan and La Chorrera - Stage 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Contribuir a mejorar las condiciones sanitarias y disminuir la contaminacin de los
cauces y ros urbanos de los Distritos de Arraijn y La Chorrera. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) incrementar la cobertura
de tratamiento y de redes de aguas residuales en el rea de intervencin del Programa; (ii) contribuir al desarrollo de
capacidades para la gestin de las obras y la sostenibilidad del sector y; (iii) promover el adecuado funcionamiento del
sistema de alcantarillado a travs de intervenciones integrales ambientales y de educacin sanitaria.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to help improve sanitary conditions and reduce pollution in urban waterways and rivers in the districts of Arraijn and La Chorrera. The specific objectives are to: (i) increase sewer and wastewater treatment coverage in the program&apos;s area of intervention; (ii) help build capacity for the management of works and sustainability in the sector; and (iii) promote the proper operation of the sewer system through comprehensive environmental and sanitation education interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
